WEBVTT

NOTE
Rolling captions: each cue re-emits the tail of the previous one, and the
window sometimes stalls so a cue repeats verbatim. Concatenated naively this
excerpt reads every clause two or three times.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
the thing about a caldera is that

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
the thing about a caldera is that
it is not a crater

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
it is not a crater at all
it is a collapse

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
at all it is a collapse

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
and the collapse is the whole story
